# Working memory authoring

When the user asks to refresh or update working memory:

1. Read `resources/prompts/working-memory-authoring-core.md` and `resources/prompts/working-memory-authoring-agent.md`.
2. Follow the agent wrapper workflow: `get_working_memory` (unless `fresh_start`) → `search_thoughts` → synthesize → `upsert_working_memory`.
3. Project `scope_key` must be the IdeaTub project UUID, not a slug.

Help: `/help/working-memory-authoring`
